From: ThaRae <76752281+ThaRae@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 11:44:53 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] LibWeb: Begin a fragment navigation on a document with no
 latest entry
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

A fragment navigation asserted that only an initial about:blank
document can reach it without a latest entry. A document that just
committed violates that: it becomes active in its navigable before the
session history executor applies the history step that holds its
entry, so a script that runs in that window — as an embedder's
run_javascript may — hit the assertion and crashed the process. Set
its latest entry to the entry it's displayed by, as the fallback
already does for the initial about:blank, which gives the update below
the same-document navigation it expects.
---
 Libraries/LibWeb/HTML/LocalNavigable.cpp | 5 ++++-
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Libraries/LibWeb/HTML/LocalNavigable.cpp b/Libraries/LibWeb/HTML/LocalNavigable.cpp
index 3ac90b5ae24230eee32aee2b9d318a4656e25bd9..9e7663d28652f67140799c9cb1213afa9c312630 100644
--- a/Libraries/LibWeb/HTML/LocalNavigable.cpp
+++ b/Libraries/LibWeb/HTML/LocalNavigable.cpp
@@ -4053,8 +4053,11 @@ void LocalNavigable::navigate_to_a_fragment(URL::URL const& url, HistoryHandling
     //         https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/13041
     //         So instead, we set its latest entry to the entry it's displayed by — as the URL and history update steps
     //         would have. The update then runs as a same-document navigation — which fires popstate and hashchange.
+    // AD-HOC: A document that just committed reaches this step before its history step is applied, too: its entry
+    //         travels to the process hosting it through the session history executor only after the document became
+    //         active, so any document may transiently have no latest entry here, and the entry it's displayed by is
+    //         the right one for those, as well.
     if (!active_document()->latest_entry()) {
-        VERIFY(active_document()->is_initial_about_blank());
         active_document()->set_latest_entry(active_entry);
     }
 
